@baseUrl = http://localhost:5037

### Salary proposal only — does not save or execute a rule
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/ai/proposals
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "description": "מצאי עובדים שהשכר שלהם גבוה מ-15000."
}

### Related department proposal
